{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Weapon? You'd have to look for something yourself. I'm not offering one","I can't supply you. Maybe ask around, without assuming anybody owes you"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"I'm not giving you anything that can hurt me","You want me to give you a gun? Are you insane?","Get your own","No weapon from me. Keep your eyes off my stuff","Go find your own, I'm not arming a stranger","I'm not agreeing to arm you!","I'd rather give you a lecture"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not mine to promise. You could check hardware stores, but I don't know what's left"}},
