{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=military,swat,elite|st=careful",{"Negative - step back"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"A weapon costs - you got something worth a gun?","Look for something you know how to handle. Don't take a guess because it's heavy"}},
