{"ASK_WEAPON","st=friendly,neutral",{"Find your own. I can't tell you where one will be"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"A weapon? I- no. I'm terrified, and I don't want to arm someone I don't know","Kitchen tools might be worth looking at. Don't count on me having a spare","N-no. Never liked guns. Now I don't know what to think","I used to reach for a wrench when anything went wrong. Different trouble now","I wouldn't agree to arm you. I'm sorry, I just can't"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Everyone needs one, and no one wants to give theirs up, can't blame you","I'm not lending weapons. Please don't ask again","You could try hardware stores or hunting lodges. I don't know what you'd find","I could talk about improvised weapons. Don't mistake me for an expert","Sorry, I can't offer you one"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'd share if I could. I can't promise a weapon","Look, if you're in trouble, say so, I can't give you much, but I can stand beside you"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","role=civilian_loner",{"Quiet doesn't mean safe. I'd choose something I actually knew how to handle"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","role=militia",{"Weapons are issued, not given, and I'm not authorized to issue anything"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|fact=player_armed",{"You've got one already... what more do you want? that thing in your hands looks plenty dangerous"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"I wish I could hand you an easy answer. I can't promise a weapon","You're welcome to look for yourself. I don't know what you'll find","Places people kept tools might be worth checking. I'm not promising a find","I trust you. Still doesn't mean I can promise to arm you","I can't point you to a rifle I know is still there. Ask around","I could talk through some ideas. We'd have to check what was actually usable","A cast-iron pan works fine, I've used one!","You've been good to us, so I won't send you chasing a made-up stash","Maybe we can discuss what would help. I can't promise a weapon","Wrap a towel around a pipe -- and you've got a good grip and a better swing!","You could ask somebody who hunts. Ask, don't assume they have spares","Tools might help if you know how to handle them. Don't hurt yourself experimenting","I wish I could -- I truly do, I'd hate to see you out there with nothing","Make friends, a friend is the best weapon there is!","Sorry. Arming somebody isn't something I'll agree to lightly","Ask around, carefully. I don't know who has something to spare","I'd rather disappoint you than promise a weapon I can't provide","You might find something useful among ordinary tools. You'd have to look","Take care of yourself, and don't wander without something in your hand!","Keep your eyes open. I can't tell you which place will have a weapon","My boy used to carry a baseball bat everywhere. Makes me think of him when people ask","Look, I want to help, but I can't, and I'm sorry","I miss the days when the hunting rifle was just for hunting","Sorry, not this time, maybe next time","I'll keep an ear out for spares, and I'll tell you if I hear of any","I can't promise a weapon for myself or anybody else","You deserve one, honestly, you've earned it","I can't offer a spare gun, and I won't speak for anybody else","I'd drive you to the armory, if there were a car, and an armory","The best weapon is a head start, so, run fast"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"You want a weapon? Hit yourself with a rock","Don't give you a weapon? I'd sooner give you a map to hell","The thought of arming you is terrifying","Why would I arm someone I don't trust?!","No weapons for you","Go find a stick, since you're good at hitting people","I'd give you my fist, if it came to that","I'm not the arsenal you're looking for","Do you ever stop wanting something that can hurt people?","Steal one, like you always do","Forget it","I don't hand out danger","I'm not going to agree to arm you","You're the kind of person who makes weapons necessary","Try breaking into a house, I hear you're good at it","Dream on!!","Not for any price","Get a conscience first!","I'd sooner arm a bear","Find your own weapons","Not now, not ever","You're not getting anything","Ha ha, no","Nope, not happening","I'd rather you walked around unarmed","Yeah, good luck finding one","You'll get no help from me","That's the last thing I'd do","Try asking someone who doesn't know you!"}},
{"ASK_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"A weapon? Anything! Find anything! A bat, a pipe, a shovel!","If I had a weapon, I'd be using it!","I'm trying to think! Don't expect an easy answer from me","Grab a branch, grab a brick, grab a brain"}},
